# UI type-icons for PD planet variants, keyed to the conditional_icon blocks in
# common/planet_classes/zz_pd_vanilla_base_classes.txt. One sheet per climate base group.
# default_frame is the cell in the sheet; it must match the order the sheet was drawn in.
# The 'uniques' sheet serves the optional Unique Worlds submod (floating/crystal/biosynth).

